From: Sergio Melas <sergiomelas@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] hwmon: (yogafan) Full driver v1.4 for legacy kernels (6.x / 7.0)

Standalone full patch adding drivers/hwmon/yogafan.c (v1.4, 3-fan support
+ 9 newly added Lenovo laptops, using devm_kzalloc for 6.x compatibility)
and Documentation/hwmon/yogafan.rst.

Kconfig and Makefile entries are registered automatically by
auto_compile_rust_lenovo_patch.sh when missing.

Signed-off-by: Sergio Melas <sergiomelas@gmail.com>
---
diff --git a/drivers/hwmon/yogafan.c b/drivers/hwmon/yogafan.c
